    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Education and Highways, do by this Order, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission,amend the Schedule to the Order published made under Section 21 of the said Act, published in Gazette ExtraordinaryNo. 420/25 of September 26, 1986 (as last amended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1876/27 ofAugust 19, 2014), which specifies the Faculties and the Departments of the Eastern University, Sri Lanka, by the additionimmediately after the item \u201c10. Department of Hindu Civilization\u201d appearing in Column II of the Schedule and whichcorresponds to the item \u201cFaculty of Arts and Culture\u201d appearing in Column I of the Schedule of the following entry :-",
